[38;2;124;124;124mThe problem: Let φ: R → S be smooth, σ: S → R a left inverse (section), I = [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mKer(σ). If I/I² is free, show the I-adic completion S^∧ ≅ R[[t₁,...,t_d]] as R-[0m
[38;2;124;124;124malgebras.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThis is a well-known result. Let me think through the proof carefully.[0m

